lemma wells_state : (∀ i:Support c, Borne b' i (movesX M H χ q n r₀ A' rA l₁ Qt k' i) p.threshold) ∧ Towed w' id cZ p.B ex (amt+zt) ∧ (∀ i U,rises (cZ i U)) ∧ (∀ i U,Healthy p.threshold i U→ cZ i U=0) ∧ (∀ i,Burns b' i (VZ i) p.threshold) ∧ Towed w' id VZ p.B ex zt :=by
   have hc:= Fan.transferredText M H χ q n r₀ A' rA hr p hB hU l₁ hl Qt k' w' hw hX h0 hP0 hP
   have hu U:= hc.repair hw U|>.2; have ht':= Fan.bakery_out M H χ q n r₀ A' rA hr p hU l₁ hl Qt k' w' hw hX h0 hP
   have hg(i): reachability i.1 ⊆ Y i:=Fan.prosper M H q n r₀ A' l₁ hl _ -- expp
   have h i: Burns b' (Y i) (LX i) p.threshold:= Fan.yieldsText M H χ rA hr p hU Qt k' ht hT b' hv Y hP hg i
   have h₀(i:Stars H M): Burns b' (reachability i.1) (L₀ i) p.threshold:= Fan.yieldsText _ _ _ _ hr p hU Qt k' ht hT b' hv _ hP0 (fun i=> Finset.Subset.refl _) i
   haveI:Countable (Stars H M):= Function.Injective.countable (foyer M H).injective
   refine ⟨fun i=> transit Y (F:=fΔ) (r:=id) (fun i=>(XPhase.bolder (h₀ i).toBorne (h i).toBorne (hg i)).sift) hu i, towing _ (fΔ) hc hw, fun i U B h=> ?_, fun i U hz=> ?_,fun i=> transitE Y (F:=LX) (r:=id) (fun i=> h _) (fun i=> (ht'.repair hw i).2) i, towing (r:=id) Y (LX) ht' hw⟩
   · by_contra H'
     apply h; unfold movesX Accent.tally; rw [Poly.share]; exact (tsum_congr (fun j=> Accent.starlet _ _ (Nat.lt_of_not_ge H'))).trans tsum_zero; exact (hu U).comp_injective Subtype.val_injective
   unfold movesX Accent.tally; refine (tsum_congr (fun j=> ?_)).trans tsum_zero
   have hU1:Healthy p.threshold (Y j.val) U:= j.property.symm ▸ hz
   have hv:messageH M H χ rA Qt k' (fun i=>reachability i.1) U j.val= messageH M H χ rA Qt k' Y U j.val:=by
       unfold messageH; apply congr_arg; rw [hU] at hU1; funext t T; unfold cursors; rw [masked_eq _ _ _ _ hU1,masked_eq _ _ _ _ (Finset.disjoint_of_subset_left (hg j.val) hU1)]
   dsimp only; rw [hv,sub_self]; ext p; by_cases h:2≤ p.val.card; rw [crest _ _ h]; exact starlet _ _ (Nat.lt_of_not_ge h)
